# The system user of the system Herkos (herkosd.service).
u herkos - "Herkos permission gate" /var/lib/herkos /usr/sbin/nologin
# Keros asks the shared local model (vilna-llm.service, package gloxi),
# whose key only the group gloxi may read (ADR 0025). The group line is
# the same as in gloxi.sysusers, so either package may make it first.
g gloxi -
m herkos gloxi
